      "name": "Slink",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>If a creature ends its movement adjacent to the viper or within the viper's space, the viper can use its reaction to Stride, Climb, or Swim up to 10 feet. It must end its movement in a location that isn't within 5 feet of a foe. This movement doesn't trigger reactions.</p>",
